# Getting Started with ExAzure

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:ex_azure, path: Path.expand("..", __DIR__)}
])
```

## Azurite setup

Start Azurite with Docker:

```bash
docker compose up -d
```

## Create a client

```elixir
credential =
  ExAzure.Identity.SharedKeyCredential.new(
    "devstoreaccount1",
    "Eby8vdM02xNOcqFlqUwJPLlmEtlCDXJ1OUzFT50uSRZ6IFsuFq2UVErCz4I6tq/K1SZFPTOtr/KBHBeksoGMGw=="
  )

client =
  ExAzure.Storage.Client.new(
    account: "devstoreaccount1",
    credential: credential,
    endpoint: "http://127.0.0.1:10000/devstoreaccount1"
  )
```

## First upload

```elixir
container = "livebook-demo"

{:ok, _} = ExAzure.Storage.Container.create(client, container)
{:ok, blob} = ExAzure.Storage.Blob.upload(client, container, "hello.txt", "Hello from Livebook!")
blob.name
```
